<title>PHILIPPINES: Solid Group sets 0.15-peso cash payout.</title>
<headline>Solid Group sets 0.15-peso cash payout.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solid Group Inc said on Thursday its board has declared a 0.15-peso cash dividend to stockholders of record as of April 22, 1997.</p>
</text>
